<!--
purpose: Record of how a committed CLAUDE.md satisfies content/01-core-rules.xml — one section per rule; the CLAUDE.md itself is built from claude-md-minimal / -standard / -monorepo.md.j2.
consumes: The committed CLAUDE.md, the manifests its commands came from, the CI run that executed them, the secret scan, the resync check.
produces: A committed record at .product/claude-md-creation/<repo>.md plus its JSON form validated by scripts/validate-claude-md-creation.py.
depends-on: templates/header.yaml, templates/extract-commands.sh, content/02-output-contract.xml, scripts/validate-claude-md-creation.py.
token-budget-impact: ~600 tokens to fill end-to-end.
-->
---
version: 0.1.0
repo: {{ repo_name }}
layout: {{ layout }}
template: {{ template }}
token_count: {{ token_count }}
---

# Repository and template

- repo: {{ repo_name }}
- layout: {{ layout }} (single | monorepo)
- template: {{ template }} (minimal 250 | standard 500 | monorepo 700 tokens)
- token_count: {{ token_count }} (within the template budget; split, never trim commands)

# Commands

One row per command in `## Commands`, extracted with templates/extract-commands.sh and run once on a clean checkout (r-commands-extracted-and-executed).

| Command | Source manifest | Comment | Ran ok |
|---|---|---|---|
| <command> | package.json \| Makefile \| pyproject.toml \| justfile \| other-manifest | <what it does> | true |

# Secrets

- secrets_scan.tool: gitleaks | trufflehog | host-builtin; clean: true
- env_vars_by_name_only: true (NAME=<required>); env_example_referenced: true

# Structure and key files

At most 20 load-bearing paths, each with a purpose; no generated directories (r-structure-lists-load-bearing-paths-only).

| Path | Purpose |
|---|---|
| <dir or file> | <one phrase> |

| Key file | Purpose | Exists at commit |
|---|---|---|
| <path> | <what only this file decides> | true |

# Gotchas

| Entry | Names |
|---|---|
| <trigger plus consequence> | file \| env-var \| command \| version-pin \| lint-rule |

# Monorepo delegation (layout monorepo only)

- root_restates_app_commands: false

| App | Per-app CLAUDE.md | Exists | Referenced by |
|---|---|---|---|
| <app> | <apps/x/CLAUDE.md> | true | import \| relative-path |

# Local settings

- personal_paths_grep_clean: true (/Users/, /home/, C:\, personal handles)
- claude_local_md_gitignored: true

# Resync check

- kind: ci-job | pre-commit-hook; location: <path>; fails_on_manifest_drift: true

# Evidence

- <CI run that executed the commands>
- <secret scan run>
- <resync check definition>
